# 33. Edge cases and special behavior

| Situation | Current behavior |
| --- | --- |
| Select the already selected palette button | Ignored; no move or additional color-selection-goal count |
| Click a cube already in the selected paint | No move, no recolor, no score |
| Recolor without an external merge | Still a valid paid move if its color changes |
| Switch to a remote region | Its component becomes active; previous paint stays, but capture progress can fall |
| Join several matching regions | They merge through face connectivity in the same accepted result |
| Very fast color/cube input | Accepted while ordinary wave animation is running if other interaction conditions permit; affected tweens can be replaced |
| Pause midway through a wave | Input and active-play clock stop; global animation time is not set to zero, so the wave can finish |
| Open Settings from Pause | Keeps play paused; BACK returns to PAUSED, not automatically to play |
| Cancel Home confirmation | Resume if opened from HUD; stay paused if opened from Pause |
| Restart midway through animation | Cancel/recycle the old presentation and prepare a new attempt; numbered initial definition remains fixed |
| Leave during first-time loading | Cancel pending generation/search presentation; no unfinished unprepared board is promised through Continue |
| Leave during Continue loading | Retain the previous valid checkpoint for a future Continue |
| Close or background the app | Attempt/lifecycle settings saves are requested; abrupt termination can still lose the latest unsaved state |
| Complete on the final move | Win, because full capture is checked before allowance exhaustion |
| Reach 99.66% and exhaust moves | Lose if cubes remain; rounded appearance is not the win condition |
| Meet a goal, then lose | No new permanent achievement; already saved goals remain |
| Repeat an earned goal | No duplicate achievement/currency grant |
| Replay with worse stars or time | Old best stars/time/moves remain; current result can display the worse present rating |
| Solver refinement times out | Retain a validated incumbent if available; do not label it optimal without proof |
| Fresh numbered definition cannot be verified | Loading error; no unverified numbered puzzle is published |
| Irregular geometry fails validation | Hollow cube geometry fallback, followed by ordinary preparation |
| Saved definition is corrupt | Preserve it and show error; Retry is not guaranteed to repair the same bad file |
| Saved unfinished data is invalid or complete | Continue hidden/unavailable |
| Old checkpoint lacks valid goal history | Avoid granting speculative current-attempt goal achievements |
| All 100 category levels complete | Stay within Level 100/LEVELS flow; no 101st level |
| Incomplete first-level goals | Can be earned on later successful replays; they do not hold Level 2 locked after a win |
| Application focus loss without suspension | Saves are requested; this is not an explicit gameplay-pause command |

A few behaviors are limitations rather than special rewards. There is no recovery of multiple abandoned attempts, no score leaderboard, no paid extension after failure, no automatic cloud restore, and no global unique-cube scoring protection against repeated component switching. Normal navigation does not expose every legacy mode or developer tool as player functionality.

