# 35. Consolidated rules and calculation reference

This chapter collects the balance rules. Examples are calculations, not a list of universal pre-generated level allowances.

| Rule | Formula / configured value | Example or exception |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Catalog capacity | 3 × 4 × 100 = 1,200 | Twelve independent unlock chains |
| Page capacity | 30, with four pages | Final page is 91–100 |
| Dimension bands | Seven sizes, advancing every 15 numbered levels | Level 16 is 8³; Level 91 is 20³ |
| Regular shell count | n³ − (n−2)³ | 6³ contains 152 playable cubes |
| Base irregular solid fill | 44–62% before size adjustment | Not final skin occupancy |
| Large-shape simplification | q = 0.65 × clamp((n−8)/12,0,1) | q = 0.65 at n = 20 |
| Adjusted irregular fill | 0.44 + 0.08q through 0.62 + 0.05q | 49.2–65.25% at 20 |
| Geometry retries | At most 3 | Hollow-cube fallback after irregular failure |
| Palette | Six colors at every difficulty | Green, purple, yellow, orange, blue, cyan |
| Initial/new score | 0 initially; B × multiplier only when new count > 0 | B is an integer 21–49 |
| Capture multiplier | 1 for 1–3; 3 for 4–6; clamp(N−3,4,7) for N ≥ 7 | 9 gives 6; 10+ gives 7 |
| Remaining moves | max(0,M−U) | 14 used of 20 leaves 6 |
| Capture fraction | 100 × active / playable | 42/152 = 27.63% |
| Completion | Active = total and total > 0 | Near-100% is not completion |
| Gold stars | 3 at U/M ≤ .7; 2 at ≤ .9; otherwise 1 on a win | No score/time/goal factor |
| Region complexity C | 1 / 1.1 / 1.25 / 1.4 / 1.6 at thresholds 80 / 150 / 250 / 400 | R = 101 uses 1.1 |
| Hard extra | round(max(1,round(.08S)) × C) | Tier order requires ≥ Expert+1 |
| Medium extra | round(max(3,round(.23S)) × C) | Tier order requires ≥ Hard+1 |
